meta {
  name: 49 how long a briefing lasts
  type: http
  seq: 49
}

put {
  url: {{host}}/_cluster/settings
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "transient": {
      "nlsearch.analysis_ttl": "7d"
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Settings - how long a briefing lasts

  How long what the plugin worked out about an index stays good for. 24 hours by default.

  A mapping change invalidates a briefing on its own, so this is about data that drifts without the mapping moving: new department codes, a status value that stops being used. Raise it for a static catalogue, lower it for data that changes shape weekly.
}
